  "notes": "The promotion's first pay-per-view. Its line-up and match build survive; the results were published only as a text file on the promotion's website. Billed: Chris Collins against Jake Davids for the Bluegrass Title in a cage; Max Pain against Revelations; the Board of Education (champions) against Southern Tradition for the tag titles; Seth Alexander against Leevon Parks for the Appalachian number-one contendership; Mike Gillis and Laramee against Devon Freemont and Dan Debacle; Dave Risk against Afwa Kilmanjaro; Sean Willey against Darren Morbius."
